+
+## What works
+
+| Part | State | |
+|---|---|---|
+| display | partly | UEFI's framebuffer, through the loader (to be checked) |
+| touch | partly | Goodix "Berlin" (gt9897t) on SPI SE13, the redwood driver with lisa's AVDD rail (touch_avdd_ldo=ldoc7) and touch_chip=goodix; written from the device tree, not yet run on the phone |
